---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import "../styles/global.css";
---

<Layout
  title="eurocloud — one CLI for European clouds"
  description="Create, list, SSH into, and destroy Hetzner and OVHcloud servers from the terminal. JSON output for agents."
  path="/"
>
  <Header current="home" />
  <main id="main">
    <section class="wrap hero">
      <div>
        <p class="kicker">v0.1 CLI</p>
        <h1>One CLI. European clouds.</h1>
        <p class="lede">
          Create, list, SSH, and destroy servers on Hetzner and OVHcloud without opening a dashboard.
          Short commands, honest defaults, <code>--json</code> for agents.
        </p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="btn" href="/docs/install">Read the docs</a>
          <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/docs/commands">See commands</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="terminal" aria-label="Example eurocloud session">
        <div class="terminal-bar" aria-hidden="true">
          <span class="dot"></span>
          <span class="dot"></span>
          <span class="dot"></span>
        </div>
        <pre><code><span class="prompt">$</span> eurocloud create --name my-app
<span class="out">Created server my-app (42)
Provider: hetzner
IPv4:     203.0.113.10</span>
<span class="prompt">$</span> eurocloud ssh my-app
<span class="out">ssh root@203.0.113.10</span>
<span class="prompt">$</span> eurocloud destroy my-app
<span class="out">Destroyed server my-app (42)</span></code></pre>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="wrap section">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2>Small surface. Real servers.</h2>
        <p>
          eurocloud is a TypeScript CLI: Commander, native fetch, and <code>ssh</code> with inherited stdio.
          Credentials come from the environment — no login flow.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid-3">
        <article class="card">
          <h3>Five verbs</h3>
          <p><code>create</code>, <code>list</code>, <code>get</code>, <code>ssh</code>, <code>destroy</code>. Same flags on every provider.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <h3>Hetzner and OVH</h3>
          <p>Bearer token for Hetzner. Signed OVH keys for Public Cloud instances. Switch with <code>--provider</code>.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <h3>Agent-ready JSON</h3>
          <p>Stable objects, string IDs, error envelopes. <code>ssh --json</code> prints the command without opening a session.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="wrap section">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2>Install and go</h2>
        <p>From this monorepo, or link the built package. Node 18+.</p>
      </div>
      <pre><code>pnpm install
pnpm --filter eurocloud build
pnpm --filter eurocloud exec eurocloud create --name my-app</code></pre>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
